{"id":21056,"name":"追逐风的时候","rarity":4,"path":"Shaman","desc":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「呵，这颗给小倒霉蛋，总能堵上她那欠债爸妈的嘴了吧，少打她几顿也好。\\n「这颗给卖酸瓜糖的老奶奶救急，小病小痛都得治了，我可不想哪天吃不到那么好的糖……」</i>\\n\\n女孩猫着腰一颗颗地细数布袋里的珠宝，忽然打了个喷嚏。\\n<i>「谁在想我？」</i>\\n\\n<i>「赛法利娅，你在这儿呐。」</i>\\n丝线盘绕在她的身后，似乎正犹豫着从哪儿开始。\\n\\n<i>「以后，追逐风的时候……」</i>\\n冰冷的金丝缠绕在她的手腕，令她动弹不得。\\n\\n<i>「也别忘了照顾好自己。」</i>\\n\\n她逃向远方，回头才发现，那斗篷绽线的一角，已被缝补如新。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21056,"name":"慌张","desc":"进入战斗后，使我方全体造成的击破伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。同类技能无法重复生效。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.16]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.18]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.22]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.24]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":115011,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110231,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":115011,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":115012,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":115012,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110233,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115013,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":412.8,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":185.76,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":154.8,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":70,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":160000},{"ItemID"